SUMMARY:Political Committee Meeting
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:The newly formed Political Committee will be opening our meetin
 gs to *members in good standing*!\n\nWe meet every other Monday at 7:00PM\
 , alternating between virtual and in person.\n\n\nCurrently\, we will limi
 t participation to those not in the committee to a 10 minute window during
  the meeting.\n\nReach out to your project delegate if you want to attend 
 the in person meeting.
