 nPBf4ZrOo/
LOCATION:The Free School\, 4950 Springfield Avenue
SUMMARY:Summer General Assembly
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Our General Assembly will take place on August 16th from 12:30 
 to 5:30 at the Free School at 4950 Springfield Avenue! \n\nAny member in g
 ood standing (who's paying dues to Philly Socialists and participating in 
 project work) can vote in our proceedings. Members of the public can atten
 d\, but can't vote.\n\nWe have open positions for Treasurer and Secretary 
 which any member in good standing can run for.\n\nWe also open our call fo
 r proposals. Any member in good standing can submit a proposal\, which can
  be a project proposal requesting a budget allotment or a policy proposal.
  Consult our guide to writing proposals here (https://cryptpad.fr/doc/#/2/
 doc/view/aEB-ij7WqdBHe27D8XSvRRxJbnR7e4jyvQnPBf4ZrOo/). \n\nPost your prop
 osal on Discord in the ⁠general-assemblies channel. The deadline to subm
 it a proposal is Friday\, August 7th at midnight.\n\nThe agenda will be po
 sted closer to the event.
CATEGORIES:General Membership Events
DTSTAMP:20260905T170333Z
CREATED:20260703T225402Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260727T200306Z
END:VEVENT
