TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTEND:20260829T003000Z
LOCATION:Ethical Society - Collier Room (Upstairs)
SUMMARY:Film Club: In The Absence Of The Sun
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Three women. Three stories. One city. \n\n*In the Absence of th
 e Sun* weaves together the slow unspooling of three Jakarta women's lives 
 via chance encounters in one fateful night. It also explores the politics 
 of desire\, class\, sex\, and gender amid the glitz and glam of the world
 ’s largest city\, under capitalism's relentless grip. \n\nJoin Philly So
 cialists for our screening of the critically-acclaimed movie on Friday (8/
 28) at @phillyethics. Light refreshments will be provided. Stick around fo
 r a brief discussion of the film afterwards. See you there!
CATEGORIES:General Membership Events
DTSTAMP:20260905T170333Z
CREATED:20260822T232014Z
END:VEVENT
