SUMMARY:Organizing 101: Talking to Strangers
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, 8/30\, 11am\, Girarden Wellness Garden\nOrganizing 101
 : Talking To Strangers & How to Canvass\n\n\nPhilly Socialists is hosting 
 at training at the Girarden Wellness Garden for new and old organizers\, o
 r anyone curious about community organizing! Come learn and practice skill
 s that will help you get the word out about your community project.
CATEGORIES:General Membership Events
