SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTEND:20260901T010000Z
LOCATION:Little Red Library\, 4515 Baltimore Ave.\, Philadelphia\, PA
SUMMARY:Partisan Summation Writing Workshop
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:The Partisan will host a workshop on how to write summations at
  the Little Red Library (4515 Baltimore Ave) on August 31 at 7 PM.\n\n\n\n
 A summation is a recap of some work you’ve done that covers what you tri
 ed\, why you tried it\, how it went\, mistakes that you made and what you
 ’re going to do from here. Writing summations and quantifying and reflec
 ting on our work is how we get smarter and strategize and is a key piece o
 f Philly Socialists’ scientific process.
CATEGORIES:General Membership Events
DTSTAMP:20260905T170333Z
CREATED:20260805T195828Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T200248Z
END:VEVENT
