SUMMARY:Philly Socialists Organizing School
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Unit 2 of our entry-level course in organizing topics. Free and
  open to the public. You don't have to have attended Unit 1 to attend or g
 et something out of Unit 2. You DO have to do the reading. Readings availa
 ble at the link in the calendar event description. We will also print them
  out for class attendees.\n\nCourse schedule:\nSeptember 3rd: Lesson 5: So
 cial Networks\nSeptember 10th: Lesson 6: Power\nSeptember 17th: Lesson 7: 
 Theories of Change\nSeptember 24th: Lesson 8: Base-building\nOctober 1st: 
 Lesson 9: Mass Action
CATEGORIES:General Membership Events
